SUMMARY:Wildwood
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 3:50pm\, 6:40pm\, 9:25pm\nWildwood is a handcrafted epic
  fantasy that transports audiences into a secret\, dangerously alive world
 . A girl’s desperate quest to save her baby brother unfolds into a spect
 acular\, high-stakes adventure through a forbidden forest full of enchante
 d creatures\, endearing allies\, and formidable adversaries—where an ent
 ire hidden realm hangs in the balance. In an era of automation\, LAIKA del
 ivers its most ambitious and globally accessible film yet—a bold fusion 
 of human-crafted artistry and cinematic storytelling from the makers of Co
 raline.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782\nFrom Pu
 shpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wildwood/HO00001782
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
