DTEND:20261031T221000Z
SUMMARY:Other Mommy
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 4:10pm\, 6:15pm\, 9:45pm\nBela\, an 8-year-old girl livi
 ng in a home with marital problems\, confronts a sinister entity that come
 s out of her closet. The presence\, whom she calls "Other Mommy\," becomes
  increasingly threatening to her and her family.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovie
 s.net/movies/other-mommy/HO00001773\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pu
 shpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/other-mommy/HO00001773
END:VEVENT
