DTEND:20261031T230000Z
SUMMARY:Clayface
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 5pm\, 7:30pm\, 9:55pm\n“Clayface” unravels one man
 ’s horrifying descent from rising Hollywood star to revenge-filled monst
 er in a story that explores the loss of one’s identity and humanity\, co
 rrosive love\, and the dark underbelly of scientific ambition.\nhttps://ww
 w.phoenixmovies.net/movies/clayface/HO00001765\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass:
  https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/clayface/HO00001765
END:VEVENT
