SUMMARY:You Can See Everything
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 6:20pm\, 8:25pm\nThirty-four days before she’s sent to
  prison\, notorious Silicon Valley founder Elizabeth Holmes invites a skep
 tical film crew to document her every move. What begins as an intimate por
 trait of an enigmatic felon becomes a mind-bending three-year journey into
  the abyss. From boundary-pushing directors Nathan Fielder and Lance Oppen
 heim comes You Can See Everything.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/y
 ou-can-see-everything/HO00001794\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushp
 in.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/you-can-see-everything/HO00001794
END:VEVENT
